  "Financial year end must be a month from 1 to 12": ["Einde van die finansiële jaar moet 'n maand van 1 tot 12 wees", "Mafelelo a ngwaga wa ditšhelete a swanetše go ba kgwedi ya 1 go fihla go 12", "Makumu ya lembe ra timali ma fanele ku va n'hweti ya 1 ku fika eka 12", "Ukuphela konyaka wezimali kufanele kube yinyanga ka-1 kuya ku-12"],
  "Formal business; focus on costs, compliance and better prices.": ["Formele besigheid; fokus op koste, nakoming en beter pryse.", "Kgwebo ya semmušo; tsepelela ditshenyegelo, kobamelo le ditheko tše kaone.", "Bindzu ra ximfumo; kongomisa eka swihlawulo, ku landzela milawu na minxavo leyinene.", "Ibhizinisi elisemthethweni; gxila ezindlekweni, ekuthobeleni nasemananini angcono."],
  "Freight forwarder": ["Vragverskeper", "Moromi wa dithoto", "Murhumeri wa nhundzu", "Umthumeli wempahla"],
  "Generated deadlines cannot be deleted; mark them as done instead": ["Gegenereerde sperdatums kan nie geskrap word nie; merk hulle eerder as klaar", "Matšatši a mafelelo a a dirilwego ke tshepedišo a ka se phumolwe; a swaye gore a phethilwe", "Masiku yo hetelela lama endliweke hi sisiteme a ma nge suriwi; ma funge leswaku ma herile", "Izinsuku zokugcina ezenziwe uhlelo azinakususwa; zimake njengeziqediwe esikhundleni salokho"],
  "Get the verified-business badge": ["Kry die geverifieerde-besigheid-kenteken", "Hwetša leswao la kgwebo ye e netefaditšwego", "Kuma xikombiso xa bindzu leri tiyisisiweke", "Thola uphawu lwebhizinisi eliqinisekisiwe"],
  "Give the deadline a title": ["Gee die sperdatum 'n titel", "Efa letšatšikgwedi la mafelelo thaetlele", "Nyika siku ro hetelela nhloko", "Nika usuku lokugcina isihloko"],
  "Give the seller a reason": ["Gee die verkoper 'n rede", "Efa morekiši lebaka", "Nyika muxavisi xivangelo", "Nika umthengisi isizathu"],
  "Give your side and upload evidence before the deadline.": ["Gee jou kant en laai bewyse op voor die sperdatum.", "Efa lehlakore la gago gomme o romele bohlatse pele ga letšatšikgwedi la mafelelo.", "Nyika tlhelo ra wena kutani u rhumela vumbhoni ku nga si fika siku ro hetelela.", "Nikeza uhlangothi lwakho bese ulayisha ubufakazi ngaphambi kosuku lokugcina."],
  "Group order is not open": ["Groepbestelling is nie oop nie", "Oda ya sehlopha ga e a bulega", "Oda ya ntlawa a yi pfulekanga", "I-oda leqembu alivulekile"],
  "Group order not found": ["Groepbestelling nie gevind nie", "Oda ya sehlopha ga e hwetšwe", "Oda ya ntlawa a yi kumiwanga", "I-oda leqembu alitholakalanga"],
  "Growing informal farm": ["Groeiende informele plaas", "Polasa ye e golago ye e sego ya semmušo", "Purasi leri kulaka leri nga riki ra ximfumo", "Ipulazi elikhulayo elingahlelekile"],
  "Hectares must be a positive number": ["Hektaar moet 'n positiewe getal wees", "Dihektara di swanetše go ba palo ye e fetago 0", "Tihekitara ti fanele ku va nhlayo leyi tlulaka zero", "Amahektha kufanele abe yinombolo engaphezu kweqanda"],
