  "If an account matches, a reset link has been sent by email or SMS. It is valid for 30 minutes.": ["As 'n rekening ooreenstem, is 'n herstelskakel per e-pos of SMS gestuur. Dit is 30 minute geldig.", "Ge akhaonte e swana, kgokagano ya go fetola e rometšwe ka imeile goba SMS. E šoma metsotso e 30.", "Loko akhawunti yi fambelana, xihlanganisi xo vuyisa xi rhumeriwile hi imeyili kumbe SMS. Xi tirha timinete ta 30.", "Uma i-akhawunti ifana, isixhumanisi sokusetha kabusha sithunyelwe nge-imeyili noma nge-SMS. Sisebenza imizuzu engama-30."],
  "Image is too large (max 2 MB)": ["Prent is te groot (maks. 2 MB)", "Seswantšho se segolo kudu (go fihla go 2 MB)", "Xifaniso xi kulu ngopfu (ku fika eka 2 MB)", "Isithombe sikhulu kakhulu (kufika ku-2 MB)"],
