  "Labour & wages": ["Arbeid en lone", "Bašomi le meputso", "Vatirhi na miholo", "Abasebenzi namaholo"],
  "Latitude must be between -90 and 90": ["Breedtegraad moet tussen -90 en 90 wees", "Latitude e swanetše go ba magareng ga -90 le 90", "Latitude yi fanele ku va exikarhi ka -90 na 90", "I-latitude kufanele ibe phakathi kuka -90 no-90"],
