  "Message cannot be empty": ["Boodskap kan nie leeg wees nie", "Molaetša o ka se be o se na selo", "Rungula a ri nge vi ri ri hava nchumu", "Umlayezo awunakuba ungenalutho"],
  "Method must be BY_HECTARES or FIXED_CROP": ["Metode moet BY_HECTARES of FIXED_CROP wees", "Mokgwa o swanetše go ba BY_HECTARES goba FIXED_CROP", "Ndlela yi fanele ku va BY_HECTARES kumbe FIXED_CROP", "Indlela kufanele ibe ngu-BY_HECTARES noma FIXED_CROP"],
  "Money coming in needs an income category": ["Geld wat inkom het 'n inkomstekategorie nodig", "Tšhelete ye e tsenago e nyaka legoro la letseno", "Mali leyi nghenaka yi lava ntlawa wa mali leyi nghenaka", "Imali engenayo idinga isigaba semali engenayo"],
  "Money going out needs an expense category": ["Geld wat uitgaan het 'n uitgawekategorie nodig", "Tšhelete ye e tšwago e nyaka legoro la tshenyegelo", "Mali leyi humaka yi lava ntlawa wa xihlawulo", "Imali ephumayo idinga isigaba sezindleko"],
