  "Move through every stage before closing as shipped, or cancel the plan": ["Gaan deur elke stadium voordat jy as verskeep sluit, of kanselleer die plan", "Feta kgatong ye nngwe le ye nngwe pele o tswalela bjalo ka ye e rometšwego, goba o khansele leano", "Hundza eka xiyenge xin'wana na xin'wana u nga si pfala tanihi leswi rhumeriweke, kumbe u khansela pulani", "Dlula kuzo zonke izigaba ngaphambi kokuvala njengokuthunyelwe, noma ukhansele uhlelo"],
