  "Not delivered": ["Nie afgelewer nie", "Ga e a išwa", "A swi yisiwanga", "Akulethiwe"],
  "Not yet formally registered. Formalising opens buyers, finance and grants.": ["Nog nie formeel geregistreer nie. Formalisering open kopers, finansiering en toelaes.", "Ga se a ngwadišwa semmušong gabjale. Go dira kgwebo ya semmušo go bula bareki, ditšhelete le dithušo.", "A nga si tsarisiwa hi ximfumo. Ku endla bindzu ri va ra ximfumo swi pfula vaxavi, timali na mimpfuno.", "Akakabhaliswa ngokusemthethweni. Ukwenza kube semthethweni kuvula abathengi, izimali noxhaso."],
  "Notification not found": ["Kennisgewing nie gevind nie", "Tsebišo ga e hwetšwe", "Xitiviso a xi kumiwanga", "Isaziso asitholakalanga"],
  "Only a confirmed statement can be reopened": ["Slegs 'n bevestigde staat kan heropen word", "Ke setatemente se se netefaditšwego fela se se ka bulwago gape", "I xitatimende lexi tiyisisiweke ntsena lexi nga pfuriwaka nakambe", "Isitatimende esiqinisekisiwe kuphela esingavulwa kabusha"],
  "Only a statement waiting for review can be confirmed": ["Slegs 'n staat wat op hersiening wag, kan bevestig word", "Ke setatemente se se letetšego tekolo fela se se ka netefatšwago", "I xitatimende lexi rindzeleke nkambelo ntsena lexi nga tiyisisiwaka", "Isitatimende esilinde ukubuyekezwa kuphela esingaqinisekiswa"],
  "Only JPEG, PNG or WebP images are allowed": ["Slegs JPEG-, PNG- of WebP-prente word toegelaat", "Ke diswantšho tša JPEG, PNG goba WebP fela tše di dumeletšwego", "I swifaniso swa JPEG, PNG kumbe WebP ntsena leswi pfumeleriweke", "Kuvunyelwe kuphela izithombe ze-JPEG, PNG noma WebP"],
  "Only JPEG, PNG or WebP photos are allowed": ["Slegs JPEG-, PNG- of WebP-foto's word toegelaat", "Ke diswantšho tša JPEG, PNG goba WebP fela tše di dumeletšwego", "I swifaniso swa JPEG, PNG kumbe WebP ntsena leswi pfumeleriweke", "Kuvunyelwe kuphela izithombe ze-JPEG, PNG noma WebP"],
  "Only PDF, JPEG, PNG, WebP or CSV files can be stored": ["Slegs PDF-, JPEG-, PNG-, WebP- of CSV-lêers kan gestoor word", "Ke difaele tša PDF, JPEG, PNG, WebP goba CSV fela tše di ka bolokwago", "I tifayili ta PDF, JPEG, PNG, WebP kumbe CSV ntsena leti nga hlayisiwaka", "Amafayela e-PDF, JPEG, PNG, WebP noma CSV kuphela angagcinwa"],
  "Only the other party can respond": ["Slegs die ander party kan reageer", "Ke lehlakore le lengwe fela le le ka arabago", "I tlhelo lin'wana ntsena leri nga hlamulaka", "Uhlangothi olunye kuphela olungaphendula"],
  "Only the person who raised it can withdraw it": ["Slegs die persoon wat dit aanhangig gemaak het, kan dit terugtrek", "Ke motho yo a e tšweleditšego fela yo a ka e boetšago morago", "I munhu loyi a wu tlakuseke ntsena loyi a nga wu tlherisela endzhaku", "Umuntu oyivulile kuphela ongayihoxisa"],
  "Only the person who started this group order, the supplier or an admin can close it": ["Slegs die persoon wat hierdie groepbestelling begin het, die verskaffer of 'n admin kan dit sluit", "Ke motho yo a thomilego oda ye ya sehlopha, mofepi goba molaodi fela ba ka e tswalelago", "I munhu loyi a sunguleke oda leyi ya ntlawa, muphakeri kumbe mulawuri ntsena lava nga yi pfalaka", "Umuntu oqale leli oda leqembu, umhlinzeki noma umphathi kuphela abangalivala"],
  "Only the selling farmer can do this": ["Slegs die verkopende boer kan dit doen", "Ke molemi yo a rekišago fela yo a ka dirago se", "I murimi la xavisaka ntsena loyi a nga endlaka leswi", "Umlimi othengisayo kuphela ongakwenza lokhu"],
  "Only the supplier who owns this catalogue can change it": ["Slegs die verskaffer wat hierdie katalogus besit, kan dit verander", "Ke mofepi yo a nago le lenaneo le fela yo a ka le fetolago", "I muphakeri loyi a nga na xikombo lexi ntsena loyi a nga xi cincaka", "Umhlinzeki onekhathalogi kuphela ongayishintsha"],
  "Open group order to explore; no purchase match was found in your records": ["Oop groepbestelling om te verken; geen aankooppassing is in jou rekords gevind nie", "Oda ya sehlopha ye e bulegilego ya go hlahloba; ga go theko ye e swanago ye e hweditšwego direkhotong tša gago", "Oda ya ntlawa leyi pfulekeke yo lavisisa; a ku kumiwanga ku xava loku fambelanaka eka tirekhodo ta wena", "I-oda leqembu elivulekile ongalihlola; akutholakalanga ukuthenga okufanayo emarekhodini akho"],
  "Order is no longer available": ["Bestelling is nie meer beskikbaar nie", "Oda ga e sa hwetšagala", "Oda a ya ha kumeki", "I-oda alisatholakali"],
