  "Overheads (R)": ["Oorhoofse koste (R)", "Ditshenyegelo tša kakaretšo (R)", "Swihlawulo swa le handle ka vuhumelerisi (R)", "Izindleko ezijwayelekile (R)"],
  "Password changed": ["Wagwoord verander", "Lentšuphetišo le fetotšwe", "Phasiwedi yi cinciwile", "Iphasiwedi ishintshiwe"],
  "Password is too long": ["Wagwoord is te lank", "Lentšuphetišo le letelele kudu", "Phasiwedi yi lehile ngopfu", "Iphasiwedi inde kakhulu"],
  "Password must be at least 8 characters and include a letter and a number": ["Wagwoord moet ten minste 8 karakters wees en 'n letter en 'n syfer insluit", "Lentšuphetišo le swanetše go ba le bonyane ditlhaka tše 8 gomme le akaretše tlhaka le nomoro", "Phasiwedi yi fanele ku va na maletere ya 8 hi xitsongo naswona yi katsa letere na nomboro", "Iphasiwedi kufanele ibe okungenani izinhlamvu ezi-8 futhi ihlanganise uhlamvu nenombolo"],
  "Personal / non-farm": ["Persoonlik / nie-plaas", "Tša motho / e sego tša polasa", "Swa munhu / leswi nga riki swa purasi", "Okomuntu siqu / okungasikho okwepulazi"],
  "Personal / non-farm spending (excluded)": ["Persoonlike / nie-plaasbesteding (uitgesluit)", "Tšhomišo ya tšhelete ya motho / ye e sego ya polasa (ga e balwe)", "Matirhiselo ya mali ya munhu / lama nga riki ya purasi (a ma hlayiwi)", "Ukusebenzisa imali komuntu siqu / okungasikho kwepulazi (akubalwa)"],
  "Photo is too large (max 2 MB)": ["Foto is te groot (maks. 2 MB)", "Seswantšho se segolo kudu (go fihla go 2 MB)", "Xifaniso xi kulu ngopfu (ku fika eka 2 MB)", "Isithombe sikhulu kakhulu (kufika ku-2 MB)"],
  "Photo not found": ["Foto nie gevind nie", "Seswantšho ga se hwetšwe", "Xifaniso a xi kumiwanga", "Isithombe asitholakalanga"],
  "Planting and harvest months must be 1 to 12": ["Plant- en oesmaande moet 1 tot 12 wees", "Dikgwedi tša go bjala le go buna di swanetše go ba 1 go fihla go 12", "Tin'hweti to byala na ku tshovela ti fanele ku va 1 ku fika eka 12", "Izinyanga zokutshala nokuvuna kufanele zibe ngu-1 kuya ku-12"],
  "Please accept the terms of use and privacy notice": ["Aanvaar asseblief die gebruiksvoorwaardes en privaatheidskennisgewing", "Hle amogela melawana ya tšhomišo le tsebišo ya sephiri", "Hi kombela u amukela milawu ya matirhiselo na xitiviso xa xihundla", "Sicela wamukele imigomo yokusebenzisa nesaziso sobumfihlo"],
  "Please agree that we may read this statement to categorise your spending (POPIA consent)": ["Stem asseblief in dat ons hierdie staat mag lees om jou besteding te kategoriseer (POPIA-toestemming)", "Hle dumela gore re ka bala setatemente se go hlopha tšhomišo ya gago ya tšhelete (tumelelo ya POPIA)", "Hi kombela u pfumela leswaku hi nga hlaya xitatimende lexi ku hlela matirhiselo ya wena ya mali (mpfumelelo wa POPIA)", "Sicela uvume ukuthi singasifunda lesi sitatimende ukuze sihlele ukusebenzisa kwakho imali (imvume ye-POPIA)"],
  "Please check your registration number and upload your registration certificate to the vault.": ["Gaan asseblief jou registrasienommer na en laai jou registrasiesertifikaat na die kluis op.", "Hle lekola nomoro ya gago ya ngwadišo gomme o romele setifikeiti sa gago sa ngwadišo polokelong.", "Hi kombela u kambela nomboro ya wena ya ku tsarisa kutani u rhumela xitifikheti xa wena xa ku tsarisa eka vuhlayiselo.", "Sicela uhlole inombolo yakho yokubhalisa bese ulayisha isitifiketi sakho sokubhalisa endaweni ephephile."],
  "Please confirm in the app once you have paid the farmer in cash.": ["Bevestig asseblief in die app sodra jy die boer kontant betaal het.", "Hle netefatša ka app ge o šetše o lefile molemi ka kheše.", "Hi kombela u tiyisisa eka app loko u hakerile murimi hi khexe.", "Sicela uqinisekise ku-app uma usumkhokhele umlimi ngokheshi."],
  "Please describe what happened (at least 10 characters)": ["Beskryf asseblief wat gebeur het (ten minste 10 karakters)", "Hle hlaloša seo se diregilego (bonyane ditlhaka tše 10)", "Hi kombela u hlamusela leswi humeleleke (kwalomu ka maletere ya 10)", "Sicela uchaze okwenzekile (okungenani izinhlamvu eziyi-10)"],
  "Please sign in": ["Meld asseblief aan", "Hle tsena", "Hi kombela u nghena", "Sicela ungene"],
  "Price cannot be negative": ["Prys kan nie negatief wees nie", "Theko e ka se be ka fase ga 0", "Nxavo a wu nge vi ehansi ka zero", "Intengo ayinakuba ngaphansi kweqanda"],
  "Price must be zero or greater": ["Prys moet nul of meer wees", "Theko e swanetše go ba 0 goba go feta", "Nxavo wu fanele ku va zero kumbe ku tlula", "Intengo kufanele ibe yiqanda noma ngaphezulu"],
  "Price per unit must be greater than zero": ["Prys per eenheid moet groter as nul wees", "Theko ka yuniti e swanetše go feta 0", "Nxavo hi yuniti wu fanele ku tlula zero", "Intengo ngeyunithi kufanele ibe ngaphezu kweqanda"],
  "Privacy notice (POPIA)": ["Privaatheidskennisgewing (POPIA)", "Tsebišo ya sephiri (POPIA)", "Xitiviso xa xihundla (POPIA)", "Isaziso sobumfihlo (POPIA)"],
